  "body": "### What is the issue with the Compatibility Standard?\n\n[3.4.5. Keyword mappings](https://compat.spec.whatwg.org/#css-keyword-mappings) states that \"These definitions of -webkit-box-* are known to not be web compatible\", but that section does not contain any `webkit-box-*` definitions.\nIt has `-webkit-box` with nothing after it, and `-webkit-flex`, `-webkit-inline-box` and `-webkit-inline-flex`.\n\nI assume that this is just a copy paste mistake from the warning in the previous section, but I thought I'd open this issue so someone who actually knows what's going on can double-check that.",
